## Overview
This lab demonstrates: 
 - Conditional statements in Bash
 - Input validation using regex
 - User interaction in hell scripts

## Task A: Lucky Number Prize Script

The script prompts the user to enter a lucky number and displays a prize message based on the input.

## Requirements

Prompt the user to input a lucky number.

If the number is 10, print "You got the first prize.".

If the number is 8, print "You got the second prize.".

If the number is 999, print "You got the third prize.".

For any other number, print "Sorry, good luck for the next time.".

